WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
Set a seedling by a window.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:06.550
Over hours to days, its shoot
curves towards the light.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.100
Lay a seedling on its side, and its
shoot turns to grow upwards again.

4
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.440
Yet a plant has no glands and
no blood to carry its messages.

5
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.420
So how can a stem grow longer,
and even bend towards a window,

6
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.710
without making new cells?

7
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.190
In this mission, you'll meet the chemical
signals made in shoot and root tips,

8
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.010
starting with auxin.

9
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.030
Then you'll zoom in on the
cells just behind the tip,

10
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.080
where auxin goes to work.

11
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:38.490
Your mission: explain how a stem can grow
longer and bend towards a window without

12
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.810
making new cells.
